preprocessing techniques for resizing and standardization.
• Enhanced data visualization and analysis skills by leveraging Python and R for data analysis, regression, and machine learning,
contributing to robust Business Intelligence insights.
• Improved operational efficiency in e-commerce projects by applying business analysis techniques with a focus on forecasting
and root cause analysis, utilizing statistics and data warehouse concepts.
• Developed scalable analytics solutions by designing and executing complex SQL queries and data warehousing strategies,
